rooms_desc ({"You walk through the entrance of Roan and Midge's second houseand find yourself in the Grand Foyer. Glancing around, you stand in awe of its magnificence. The high cathedral ceiling and polished woodfloor contribute to the open and spacious feel of the room. All     around you a variety of exotic trees and plants collected fromaround the world give you the impression of being in a rainforest.Sunlight streams into the room through the skylights in the ceilingand the large bay windows in the front of the house. Across the Foyeryou see three wood steps leading up into the Great Room.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
